fix: crash loop on stale ffmpeg path, silent replay, clearer errors

- getValidFfmpegPath no longer infinite-recurses when portable temp path vanishes
- Instant Replay now captures Chromium loopback and muxes audio on save
- Replay/record use validated ffmpeg path; stop loopback cleanly on pause/stop
- Friendlier errors for capture option failures instead of generic "hit a problem"
